PicoBB — BBC BASIC for the Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040 console build)
===================================================================

The BBC BASIC interpreter itself (PicoBB and the BBCSDL core it embeds) is
distributed under the zlib licence. The shipped binary also statically links
two bundled components under their own permissive terms (LittleFS and the
Raspberry Pi Pico SDK runtime, both BSD-3-Clause), plus the standard
arm-none-eabi GCC runtime. Each notice is reproduced below.

Only the components actually compiled into THIS minimal UART-console
configuration are listed. FatFS, lwIP, the CYW43 WiFi driver and the
custom-licensed m0FaultDispatch.c are NOT part of this build (see README.md).


